      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Level and momentum point in different directions: the series remains near 1.6 million and rebounded 70 thousand in Q3, but total gross gains eased from 7.585 million to 7.475 million. Recent Q4 strength supports an elevated anchor, while the softer 2025 labor-flow backdrop warrants a modest downward adjustment. No discrete policy or identifiable one-off mechanism justifies a larger shift."
